    <item>
      <title>AUTH</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/auth/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/auth/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/44c81a133f36df073fe90167908ea5ad.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ta tập trung vào tài khoản &lt;code&gt;student&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/4f6fafde687e3d96e0a7f83e4f4d633c.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Để ý thấy có format &lt;code&gt;host sudo: &lt;/code&gt;
Nên ta dùng grep theo format đó&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/2f750235060315eccbe675c89f843813.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ta thấy đoạn mã đáng ngờ bị mã hóa theo base64&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/7d741b8f7ca4fce9e28fc4941b75f96e.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>CTQ1</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/ctq1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/ctq1/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Khi đọc file pcap ta thấy ó file script.ps1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/4cfd69e1762e0935fdd201c27c506f8a.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Export HTTP object list ta được &lt;code&gt;flag.txt&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code&gt;script.ps1&lt;/code&gt;
Ta mở file &lt;code&gt;flag.txt&lt;/code&gt; thấy flag giả&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/f2dfd7dfe56ad8b7b5ee1ca7ddab7c01.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/cdec96486493581e32dc5ba8f51651bf.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Đọc code của file &lt;code&gt;.ps1&lt;/code&gt; tạm hiểu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Đầu tiên file được mã hóa base64 2 lần&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sau đó đổi &amp;ldquo;=&amp;rdquo; thành &amp;ldquo;-&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sau đó upload lên thông qua FTP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ta export toàn bộ FTP-DATA object list&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/2dabda1346012592c21e6de2bf57a1a1.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sau đó ta viết chương trình dịch ngược đoạn mã hóa&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>EnderDragon</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/enderdragon/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/enderdragon/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Đọc giới thiệu ta thấy đây là file map minecraft&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/89c1e5d8161d670cd20a8d29953439db.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nhập file game zô, ta thấy có bản đồ&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/516af95cb6cd19b0e88af6162e35cf20.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Để thuận tiện tra map ta tìm vị trí bằng tool đọc map mc&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/b5f5f43297a7c5637556e694931267e6.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ta tìm được tọa độ giống trong map&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/b0e2b38c6c83181fd7544f66381a8948.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dùng ChestESP tìm cho tiện ta thấy nội dung ghi ko phải dưới đất
Ta tìm và thấy rương trên trời&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/dd4ab6069292c21cea5def4381f92ac9.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ghép lại ta có flag : KCSC{Bur13d_7reaSur3}&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>OnthiTHPT</title>
