      <guid>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/onthithpt/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Chuyển đổi đuôi &lt;code&gt;.docx&lt;/code&gt; thành &lt;code&gt;.docx.zip&lt;/code&gt;
Truy cập theo đường dẫn &lt;code&gt;OnthiTHPT\De-thi-thu-TN-THPT-2026-mon-Toan-So-GD-Tuyen-Quang\word\media&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/c586f6a17f9b89ab73df64638bb0f16a.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/dd0a3e6dee040ff5f89fe1f95ec41d92.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
