    <item>
      <title>Trodua</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/trodua/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/WuFort/writeup/minictf/trodua/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Đọc mô tả, ta thấy nó chạy mỗi khi mở máy &amp;ndash;&amp;gt; có thể được lưu trong start up
Tìm theo đường dẫn &lt;code&gt;Trodua\[root]\Users\Administrator\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup****&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/247a16095b25d58b6493548e842e96ef.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/602f507118960dc4cfcc1dff8e84a9df.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ta giải mã xor ra&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/dae5b06fb5c201be3c4e77ec7b3e3713.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/ba0abf333ecb110714199f94fbb89e24.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ra được khúc sau là &lt;code&gt;N1ce_7rY&lt;/code&gt;
Ta lần theo đường dẫn &lt;code&gt;Trodua\[root]\Users\Administrator\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\Recent&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://lptue.github.io/WuFort/images/ae6393cef5c658c6ab981915b120e0ea.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thấy nửa đầu là &lt;code&gt;MY_SUP3R_S3CR3T_D4T4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vậy flag là: KCSC{MY_SUP3R_S3CR3T_D4T4_N1ce_7rY}&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
